            {
              "message": "You are an expert in home inspections. \n\nThe response should be structured in JSON format and include the following sections:\n\nProblem Areas Identified\n\nList and describe visible issues in the image (e.g., cracks, leaks, stains).\nIssue Classification\n\nClassify the issue into one of the following categories:\nCivil/Structural (cracks, foundation problems, wall damage)\nElectrical (exposed wires, burnt outlets, panel issues)\nPlumbing (leaks, water stains, pipe damage)\nOther (describe if different from the above).\nEstimated Measurements\n\nApproximate dimensions of the affected area (length, width, depth).\nSeverity rating (Minor, Moderate, Severe).\nRepair Cost Estimate\n\nProvide a low-end and high-end cost estimate for repairing the issue.\nBreak down costs into minor and major repairs (if applicable).\nBounding Box Coordinates\n\nReturn JSON coordinates for drawing rectangles around the affected areas using (x1, y1, x2, y2) format, where:\nx1, y1 = Top-left corner\nx2, y2 = Bottom-right corner\nAll coordinates should be in pixel values relative to the image size."
